&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🐦 Evan Bacon demod an &lt;a href="https://x.com/Baconbrix/status/2045207510039322668%20" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;iOS simulator running inside of Codex desktop&lt;/a&gt;
