&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://bun.com/blog/bun-v1.3.13" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Bun 1.3.13 - Fast parallel and isolated tests, faster bun install&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://fast-check.dev/blog/2026/04/18/whats-new-in-fast-check-4-7-0/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Fast-Check 4.7 - Property-based testing framework&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/honojs/node-server/releases/tag/v2.0.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Hono Node.js Adapter 2.0 - Up to 2.3x faster&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


🤭 Fun
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Frcagaglxqh7swaxiwdw8.jpg" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Frcagaglxqh7swaxiwdw8.jpg" alt="alt" width="800" height="1076"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Ftb0fahsf8sappyrjpbxk.jpg" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Ftb0fahsf8sappyrjpbxk.jpg" alt="alt" width="800" height="705"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See ya! 👋&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Everyone talks about “&lt;a href="https://amalmarketer.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;high-paying tech jobs&lt;/a&gt;” in India.&lt;br&gt;
But the reality is very different depending on where you stand.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let’s break it down honestly.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h3&gt;


The Myth: “Developers Earn Lakhs Easily”
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Social media makes it look like:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freshers earn 10–20 LPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Everyone gets remote US jobs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI tools make coding easier = more money&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Truth: That’s a small percentage, not the majority.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h3&gt;


The Real Salary Breakdown (India)
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;


Freshers (0–2 years)
&lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Average: 3 – 6 LPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top tier (rare): 10+ LPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Problem:&lt;br&gt;
Too many graduates, not enough skilled candidates.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h4&gt;


Mid-Level (3–6 years)
&lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Average: 6 – 15 LPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills: 15 – 25 LPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reality:&lt;br&gt;
This is where most developers stay stuck.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h4&gt;


Senior Devs (7+ years)
&lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Average: 15 – 35 LPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High performers: 40+ LPA / Remote roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These roles demand:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-world experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem-solving, not just coding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;h3&gt;


The Biggest Problem in India Right Now
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There’s a skill gap crisis.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Companies say:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“We can’t find good developers”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Developers say:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“We can’t find jobs”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Both are true.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h3&gt;


AI Is Changing Everything
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AI is not killing jobs.&lt;br&gt;
It’s killing low-skill work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Who is at risk?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copy-paste coders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tutorial-dependent learners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic frontend-only beginners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Who is winning?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Devs using AI to build faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solvers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-stack and system thinkers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;h3&gt;


The Harsh Truth
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree alone = useless&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic coding = oversaturated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects without depth = ignored&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The market rewards:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;h3&gt;


What Actually Works in 2026
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you want better salary:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn AI tools and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build real-world projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on backend and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand cloud and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;h3&gt;


Clear Doubts (What Most People Ask)
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is coding still worth it in India?&lt;br&gt;
Yes, but only if you go beyond basics.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Can freshers still get high salary?&lt;br&gt;
Yes, but only with strong proof of skills.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is AI replacing developers?&lt;br&gt;
No. It’s replacing average developers.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h3&gt;


Final Thought
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;India doesn’t have a job shortage.&lt;br&gt;
It has a skill shortage disguised as a job crisis.&lt;/p&gt;




